```console
$ scherzo-cloud auth --help
Manage your Scherzo Cloud sign-in

Usage: scherzo-cloud auth [COMMAND]

Commands:
  identity  Manage your linked sign-in identities
  login     Sign in
  logout    Sign out on this device
  status    Show your sign-in status
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
